# "If you've committed a crime this turn, discard a card." On turn 1 Bot1 casts Oko, then a Lightning Bolt at Bot2 (targeting an
# opponent is a crime) and uses +1: it draws a Forest and an Island and discards only one (the Island). On turn 3, with that crime a
# turn behind it, +1 draws two Islands to the Forest, Grizzly Bears and Island of the hand and discards two.

